{"type":"message_start","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_iuagXzNGkhzP6HsPTEHG4658","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: test-driven-development\ndescription: 在编写任何功能或修复 bug 的实现代码之前使用\n---\n\n# 测试驱动开发（TDD）\n\n## 概述\n\n先写测试。看它失败。写最小代码让它通过。\n\n**核心原则：** 如果你没有亲眼看到测试失败，你就不知道它是否在测试正确的东西。\n\n**违反规则的字面意义，就是违反规则的精神。**\n\n## 何时使用\n\n**始终使用：**\n- 新功能\n- Bug 修复\n- 重构\n- 行为变更\n\n**例外情况（需询问你的人类协作者）：**\n- 一次性原型\n- 生成代码\n- 配置文件\n\n脑子里冒出\"这次先跳过 TDD\"？停下。那是在为自己找借口。\n\n## 铁律\n\n```\n没有失败的测试，不得编写任何生产代码\n```\n\n先写代码再写测试？删掉。重来。\n\n**无例外：**\n- 不要留着当\"参考\"\n- 不要在写测试时\"改造\"它\n- 不要看它\n- 删除就是删除\n\n从测试出发重新实现。就这样。\n\n## 红-绿-重构\n\n### 红 — 写失败测试\n\n===== testing-anti-patterns =====\n# 测试反模式\n\n**加载此参考文档的时机：** 编写或修改测试时、添加 mock 时，或者想在生产代码中添加仅用于测试的方法时。\n\n## 概述\n\n测试必须验证真实行为，而非 mock 行为。Mock 是隔离的手段，不是被测试的对象。\n\n**核心原则：** 测试代码做了什么，而不是 mock 做了什么。\n\n**严格遵循 TDD 能防止这些反模式。**\n\n## 铁律\n\n```\n1. 永远不要测试 mock 行为\n2. 永远不要在生产类中添加仅用于测试的方法\n3. 永远不要在不理解依赖的情况下进行 mock\n```\n\n## 反模式 1：测试 Mock 行为\n\n**为什么这是错的：**\n- 你在验证 mock 是否有效，而不是组件是否有效\n- 对真实行为什么都没说明\n\n**决策门：**\n```\n在对任何 mock 元素进行断言之前：\n  问：\"我在测试真实组件行为，还是仅仅 mock 的存在？\"\n\n  如果是在测试 mock 的存在：\n    停止——删除该断言或取消 mock 该组件\n\n  改为测试真实行为\n```\n\n## 反模式 2：在生产代码中添加仅用于测试的方法\n\n**为什么这是错的：**\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786914059450}}
{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_iuagXzNGkhzP6HsPTEHG4658","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: test-driven-development\ndescription: 在编写任何功能或修复 bug 的实现代码之前使用\n---\n\n# 测试驱动开发（TDD）\n\n## 概述\n\n先写测试。看它失败。写最小代码让它通过。\n\n**核心原则：** 如果你没有亲眼看到测试失败，你就不知道它是否在测试正确的东西。\n\n**违反规则的字面意义，就是违反规则的精神。**\n\n## 何时使用\n\n**始终使用：**\n- 新功能\n- Bug 修复\n- 重构\n- 行为变更\n\n**例外情况（需询问你的人类协作者）：**\n- 一次性原型\n- 生成代码\n- 配置文件\n\n脑子里冒出\"这次先跳过 TDD\"？停下。那是在为自己找借口。\n\n## 铁律\n\n```\n没有失败的测试，不得编写任何生产代码\n```\n\n先写代码再写测试？删掉。重来。\n\n**无例外：**\n- 不要留着当\"参考\"\n- 不要在写测试时\"改造\"它\n- 不要看它\n- 删除就是删除\n\n从测试出发重新实现。就这样。\n\n## 红-绿-重构\n\n### 红 — 写失败测试\n\n===== testing-anti-patterns =====\n# 测试反模式\n\n**加载此参考文档的时机：** 编写或修改测试时、添加 mock 时，或者想在生产代码中添加仅用于测试的方法时。\n\n## 概述\n\n测试必须验证真实行为，而非 mock 行为。Mock 是隔离的手段，不是被测试的对象。\n\n**核心原则：** 测试代码做了什么，而不是 mock 做了什么。\n\n**严格遵循 TDD 能防止这些反模式。**\n\n## 铁律\n\n```\n1. 永远不要测试 mock 行为\n2. 永远不要在生产类中添加仅用于测试的方法\n3. 永远不要在不理解依赖的情况下进行 mock\n```\n\n## 反模式 1：测试 Mock 行为\n\n**为什么这是错的：**\n- 你在验证 mock 是否有效，而不是组件是否有效\n- 对真实行为什么都没说明\n\n**决策门：**\n```\n在对任何 mock 元素进行断言之前：\n  问：\"我在测试真实组件行为，还是仅仅 mock 的存在？\"\n\n  如果是在测试 mock 的存在：\n    停止——删除该断言或取消 mock 该组件\n\n  改为测试真实行为\n```\n\n## 反模式 2：在生产代码中添加仅用于测试的方法\n\n**为什么这是错的：**\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786914059450}}
{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a complete understanding of the existing tests. The existing prompt package tests still check the OLD behavior (GeneratePlanPrompt / GenerateEasyPromptFile etc.), and I must not break them.\n\nNow, the key insight: The task10 test (task10.py) tests `PIBuilder.BuildPlan` and `rick plan --dry-run` (via handler.PlanDryRun → PIBuilder.BuildPlan).\n\nMy plan:\n1. Add `ReadEmbeddedSkill(name)` to `internal/prompt/manager.go`.\n2. Modify `internal/builder/pibuilder.go`'s `BuildPlan` to inline grilling (and tdd-zh, testing-anti-patterns-zh) content using `ReadEmbeddedSkill`, and return error if missing.\n3. Modify the plan template (plan.md) to have an inline section variable, OR use a different mechanism.\n\nWait, but I need to be careful about the plan.md template. The `BuildPlan` uses `p.manager().LoadTemplate(\"plan\")` which loads the SAME embedded plan.md template. If I modify plan.md, the existing `GeneratePlanPrompt` (in prompt package) also uses plan.md, and its tests check for \"skill_grilling\" reference and \"NoUnreplacedVars\". So I need to make sure modifying plan.md doesn't break those tests.\n\nThe existing plan_prompt_test.go checks:\n- `TestGeneratePlanPrompt_HasGrillingSkillPath`: `strings.Contains(prompt, \"skill_grilling\")` → must still contain \"skill_grilling\".\n- `TestGeneratePlanPrompt_NoUnreplacedGrillingVar`: `!strings.Contains(prompt, \"{{grilling_skill_path}}\")`.\n- `TestGeneratePlanPrompt_NoUnreplacedVars`: `!strings.Contains(prompt, \"{{\")`.\n\nSo if I add a new variable `{{grilling_content}}` (or similar) to plan.md, I MUST set it in `GeneratePlanPrompt` (the prompt package function) too, otherwise \"NoUnreplacedVars\" would fail.\n\nHmm. So if I modify the plan.md template to add inline sections, I'd need to update BOTH `GeneratePlanPrompt` (prompt package) and `BuildPlan` (builder package) to set the new variables.\n\nAlternatively, I can avoid modifying plan.md entirely and instead do the inlining in the builder package by POST-PROCESSING the built instance, or by building the inline section separately and appending it.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The cleanest approach that minimizes template changes:\n\n**Approach: Append inline skill sections to the instance in the builder, without modifying the template.**\n\nIn `BuildPlan`:\n1. Build the instance as before (using plan.md template).\n2. Read grilling/tdd/testing-anti-patterns contents via `ReadEmbeddedSkill`.\n3. Append a section to the instance:\n```\n\\n\\n## 内联技能内容（单文件内聚）\\n\\n{{grilling content}}...\n```\n\nBut wait, the test checks `grep -c '{{'` == 0 on the FULL output. If I append grilling content that itself contains `{{...}}`, that would fail. Let me check grilling.md for `{{`:\n\nLooking at grilling.md content, it has no `{{`. Let me verify by checking. Actually I already read grilling.md — it has no `{{` placeholders. Good.\n\nBut tdd-zh.md and testing-anti-patterns-zh.md might have `{{`. Let me check. Actually, the grilling content is what the test checks. Let me check if tdd-zh and testing-anti-patterns-zh have `{{`.\n\nActually, let me be careful. The test `grep -c '{{'` must be 0. If I inline tdd-zh or testing-anti-patterns-zh and they contain `{{`, that breaks the test. Let me check those files.\n\nActually, let me reconsider scope. The test ONLY requires grilling inline. The KR says \"关键 skill/loop 内容内联\". But to be safe and minimal, I'll inline grilling into plan (which the test checks), and also inline tdd/testing-anti-patterns if they don't contain `{{`.\n\nLet me check the content of tdd-zh.md and testing-anti-patterns-zh.md.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_iE3YJlNus0p3yQzuBS367274","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && for f in tdd-zh testing-anti-patterns-zh grilling doing_loop debug_skill learning_loop gen-skill gen-loop gen-domain im