e sense_loop main prompt inlines the think/research/exporter agent content instead of path references.\n\nLet me look at the sense_loop.md template to understand what it references.\n\nActually, I think I'm overcomplicating this. Let me focus on what's TESTED and clearly required, implement it cleanly, and make the other Build* methods at least consistent (switch to ReadEmbeddedSkill for the loops they already inline).\n\nLet me check the sense_loop template and think/research/exporter templates briefly."}}
