e_loop main prompt inlines the think/research/exporter agent content instead of path references.\n\nLet me look at the sense_loop.md template to understand what it references.\n\nActually, I think I'm overcomplicating this. Let me focus on what's TESTED and clearly required, implement it cleanly, and make the other Build* methods at least consistent (switch to ReadEmbeddedSkill for the loops they already inline).\n\nLet me check the sense_loop template and think/research/exporter templates briefly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_kafyaVQKCC2oOgrsKjGe9244","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/internal/prompt/templates/sense_loop.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_stbdtvsy3t3dr5Yz61Hb6148","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && echo \"=== debug_skill.md ===\" && cat internal/prompt/templates/skills/debug_skill.md && echo \"=== import_ctx head ===\" && head -20 internal/prompt/templates/skills/import_ctx.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":725,"output":3424,"cacheRead":109696,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":3261,"totalTokens":113845,"cost":{"input":0.000315375,"output":0.00297888,"cacheRead":0.000397648,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0036919030000000003}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786914059452,"responseId":"2b00b627-f73c-4f87-a659-54b3d304207e","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"}}
